ncept · independently authored"},{"id":"NEWDER-042","sourceQ":766,"stem":"A black Etruscan vessel made of bucchero is an example of what material category?","choices":["Pottery","Glass","Bronze","Marble","Parchment"],"answer":"Pottery","why":"Bucchero is a type of Etruscan black pottery.","label":"A black Etruscan vessel made of bucchero is an example of what material ","skill":"Adjacent concept · independently authored"},{"id":"NEWDER-043","sourceQ":767,"stem":"Which nineteenth-century workers' movement resisted machinery they associated with lost livelihoods?","choices":["Luddism","Chartism","Suffragism","Carbonarism","Dadaism"],"answer":"Luddism","why":"Luddites attacked or opposed machinery in industrial Britain.","label":"Which nineteenth-century workers' movement resisted machinery they assoc","skill":"Adjacent concept · independently authored"},{"id":"NEWDER-044","sourceQ":768,"stem":"An elongated Walking Man sculpture is most closely associated with which artist?","choices":["Alberto Giacometti","Henry Moore","Constantin Brâncuși","Marino Marini","Alexander Calder"],"answer":"Alberto Giacometti","why":"Giacometti made thin, elongated walking human figures.","label":"An elongated Walking Man sculpture is most closely associated with which","skill":"Adjacent concept · independently authored"},{"id":"NEWDER-045","sourceQ":769,"stem":"In what year did President Monroe articulate the doctrine named after him?","choices":["1823","1776","1815","1861","1918"],"answer":"1823","why":"The Monroe Doctrine was announced in 1823.","label":"In what year did President Monroe articulate the doctrine named after hi","skill":"Adjacent concept · independently authored"},{"id":"NEWDER-046","sourceQ":770,"stem":"The Soviet invasion of Afghanistan occurred in which year?","choices":["1979","1968","1975","1989","1991"],"answer":"1979","why":"Soviet military intervention began in December 1979.","label":"The Soviet invasion of Afghanistan occurred in which year","skill":"Adjacent co